-- Description:
-- PWM with CSR access over the SBI bus :
-- * PWM_registers (generated by regtool from hdl/csr/PWM.hjson) : cfg,
--   prescaler, period, duty
-- * pwm_core : prescaler, PWM counter and output (8-bit prescaler ratio,
--   8-bit period and duty)
